[17592186068937 #edb/ref 1043 #edb/ref 17592186069780 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068937 #edb/ref 1044 #edb/ref 17592186045463 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068937 #edb/ref 1045 "Simplifying Square Root Expressions Using the Quotient Rule" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068937 #edb/ref 1046 #edb/ref 17592186069776 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068937 #edb/ref 1049 #edb/ref 17592186050887 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068937 #edb/ref 1050 420.0 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186068937 #edb/ref 1053 #uuid "3fcb435e-dc90-5888-b34e-40125c4a37f1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186069776 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186069777 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186069776 #edb/ref 1061 40513 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186069776 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "2bc45b7b-b768-5e67-92eb-6d8dfdb26080" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186069776 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186069998 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186069777 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186069780 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186069777 #edb/ref 1061 40520 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186069777 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "92bbfce1-1705-5e28-a0bf-e544d5fecdf9" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186069777 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186068836 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186069778 #edb/ref 1061 40523 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186069778 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "57fbfe53-6167-5a8c-ac3b-d190aa02b687" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186069778 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186069999 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186069779 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186069778 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186069779 #edb/ref 1061 40568 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186069779 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "25606295-3ea3-509a-91f7-294ef43bb1c1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186069779 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186068837 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186069780 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186069779 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186069780 #edb/ref 1061 40586 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186069780 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "d917615e-b6ee-5929-8832-7bcfe670df91" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186069780 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186068838 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186069998 #edb/ref 1064 "To simplify radical expressions, we can use the quotient rule for radicals, which states \n\n$$\n\\dfrac {\\sqrt {a}} {\\sqrt{b}} = \\sqrt{\\dfrac a b}.\n$$\n\nFor example, let's simplify $\\sqrt{\\dfrac{16w^2}{25}}$\n\nFirst, we put the numerator and denominator under separate radicals and then simplify the result:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{\\dfrac{16w^2}{25}}  = \\dfrac {\\sqrt{16w^2}} {\\color{blue}\\sqrt{25}} = \\dfrac{\\sqrt{16w^2}}{\\color{blue}\\sqrt{5^2}} = \\dfrac{\\sqrt{16w^2}}{\\color{blue}5}\n$$\n\nNow, notice that the expression inside the radical is a perfect square. So, we can continue simplifying by writing the expression under the radical as a perfect square and taking its square root:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\sqrt{16{w}^{2}}}{5} & = \\\\ \\frac{\\sqrt{(4w)^{2}}}{5} & = \\\\ \\frac{|4w|}{5} & = \\\\ \\frac{|4|\\cdot |w|}{5} & = \\\\ \\frac{4\\cdot |w|}{5} & = \\\\ \\frac{4|w|}{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186069998 #edb/ref 1065 6691 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186069998 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "7bfc07d9-feb0-5bcc-b3f0-50bb42eb2b6d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186069998 #edb/ref 1067 "Introduction" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186069999 #edb/ref 1064 "The quotient rule for radicals also works for higher-order roots, like the cube root:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt[3]{ \\dfrac a b } = \\dfrac{ \\sqrt[3]{a} }{ \\sqrt[3]{b} }\n$$\n\nIn general, we have the following result:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt[n]{ \\dfrac a b } = \\dfrac{ \\sqrt[n]{a} }{ \\sqrt[n]{b} }\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186069999 #edb/ref 1065 6692 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186069999 #edb/ref 1066 #uuid "a1d735da-05d5-5959-9226-229b7c29c497" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186069999 #edb/ref 1067 "The Quotient Rule for Cube Roots and Other Radicals" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
